OL,3,GNEWSAHow #274m road saga has dragged on
OL,4,Afor more than 20 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe discovery of a rare bat colony
OL,7,Fmeant a #274m plan for a new route
OL,8,Feffectively became a road to nowhere
OL,9,Flast year.
OL,11,FBut since taking control of Norfolk
OL,12,FCounty Council, Reform UK has been
OL,13,Ftrying to revive the controversial
OL,14,FNorwich Western Link (NWL) project.
OL,16,FPrevious administrations spent years
OL,17,Fand millions of pounds before having to
OL,18,Fdrop the idea.
OL,20,FIt is a saga that has spanned more than
OL,21,Ftwo decades, so how did we get here?
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
